hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1236","Muhammad bin Al-Ala bin Kurayb told us, Abu Khaled told us, Al-Hussein bin Al-Muttab informed us, on the authority of Abdullah bin Buraidah, on the authority of Imran bin Husayn said: I asked the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, about the prayer of a man sitting, and the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “The prayer of standing.” The prayer of one who is sitting is better than half of the prayer of one who is standing.”"
